# Force LF line endings for all text files. The Go tooling (gofmt,
# language servers, vet output) expects LF; CRLF in committed source
# produced spurious whole-file gofmt -d diffs and editor-sensitive
# noise on unrelated commits. Existing CRLF files were normalised in
# a single commit; see .git-blame-ignore-revs so `git blame` skips it.
#
# `text=auto` lets git autodetect text vs binary, so PNG/mbtiles/etc
# remain untouched. `eol=lf` enforces LF on anything classified as text.
* text=auto eol=lf
